{"words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "أَنزَلْنَآ", "translation": "We revealed"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتٍۭ", "translation": "Verses"}, {"text": "بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "clear"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يَكْفُرُ", "translation": "disbelieves"}, {"text": "بِهَآ", "translation": "in them"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ", "translation": "the defiantly disobedient"}], "sahih": "And We have certainly revealed to you verses [which are] clear proofs, and no one would deny them except the defiantly disobedient."}